BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-01-05-bike1-ride-with-cadence-dr@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003913Z
DTSTART:20270105T063000
DTEND:20270105T074000
SUMMARY:[RW] Ride with cadence drills (70 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min warm-up\; 34 min easy\; 6 x (0.5 min steady + 2.5 min e
 asy)\; 8 min cool-down. Six short high-cadence spins (about 100 rpm\, smo
 oth)\, easy between. Skill\, not strength. Do not do this right before a 
 run: high cadence raises the cost of the run that follows (Walsh 2019).\n
 \nWeek 7 (BASE). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move mean
 s stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
